47
00:03:41,224 --> 00:03:41,884
The Voting System.

48
00:03:42,704 --> 00:03:45,964
The system uses end-to-end verifiable cryptography.

49
00:03:46,524 --> 00:03:50,623
Each voter gets a receipt that proves they voted, without proving how they

50
00:03:50,623 --> 00:03:51,123
