51
00:03:51,624 --> 00:03:53,244
This is called a "zero-knowledge proof,"

52
00:03:53,904 --> 00:03:56,884
which sounds like something a philosophy student made up during an exam

53
00:03:56,884 --> 00:04:01,484
they didn't study for, but it's real mathematics, and it works, and politicians

54
00:04:01,484 --> 00:04:03,424
