57
00:04:07,324 --> 00:04:11,804
Math is undefeated against politicians, which is the only undefeated record

58
00:04:11,804 --> 00:04:13,224
in your species' history.

59
00:04:14,004 --> 00:04:16,024
Every ballot published anonymized.

60
00:04:16,544 --> 00:04:18,704
Biometric data never leaves your device.

61
00:04:19,104 --> 00:04:20,444
