79
00:05:08,764 --> 00:05:11,574
Stops about ninety percent of fraud, which is the lazy fraud,

80
00:05:12,284 --> 00:05:15,784
which is most fraud, because cheating, like everything else your species

81
00:05:15,784 --> 00:05:20,424
does, follows a power law where most of the cheating is done by amateurs

82
00:05:20,424 --> 00:05:23,644
who give up if you ask them to verify their phone number.

83
00:05:24,364 --> 00:05:26,884
This is the "are you a human" layer.

84
00:05:27,424 --> 00:05:28,224
The bar is low.

85
00:05:28,844 --> 00:05:32,164
The fact that it catches ninety percent of attempts tells you something

86
